{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：08:34 2026-06-04 HKT</p>\n\n<p>粉嶺公路發生車禍。今日（4日）早上近8時，粉嶺公路往九龍方向近松柏塱發生3車相撞意外，涉及巴士、小巴和中型貨車；其中小巴司機被困，多人受傷。警方及消防接報趕到現場救援，消防員其後將小巴司機救出，事件中共有23人受傷，意外原因有待調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"小巴司機被困，由救援人員救出送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2f01b12f203087a14fc9fb589575481/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_09_55_39_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"車禍還涉及巴士和貨車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e06263b31ef18a6cd76360de33fc99ac/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_09_55_39_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a1e3efcc3f37a7879a620fefecb57a1/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_09_55_38_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42183f851692617c48ad23435d95bc68/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_09_55_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"3車相撞包括小巴，多人受傷。fb香港人香港地交通資訊群圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e36e1eae0446ab46f3f10f52513990f4/2026-06/1_12_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/714283d35ebf7ebc2b9fb05921a8f846/2026-06/2_5_3.jpg\"/>\n<p>傷者之中，小巴男司機一度被困，腳部受傷清醒，另外10男8女小巴乘客輕傷。而巴士有2名男乘客輕傷清醒；貨車男司機和1名女乘客亦輕傷。全部23名傷者分別由救護車送院治理。</p>\n<img alt=\"部分傷者獲送往大埔那打素醫院治理。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0ae1b3d72ab7b3d9b44e41d8623241d7/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_09_48_58.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"部分傷者獲送往大埔那打素醫院治理。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/338344435e00db66202621f2e17d75e4/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_09_48_59_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/87f5ece0ee31df758cf89f620b19e542/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-04_at_09_48_59_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"fb馬路的事討論區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c541ae03944426a03fb4035525a5de97/2026-06/715263956_10174379671735507_7420577162005385881_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"fb馬路的事討論區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a637df0ffb7122eb410ef582803de20b/2026-06/713286502_10174379672655507_7814146770372052731_n.jpg\"/>\n<p>受意外影響期間，運輸署表示，粉嶺公路往九龍方向近松柏塱的部分行車線需要封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車，上址交通繁忙。</p>\n<img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27faa62382b314d989b4ddc3596a14e5/2026-06/711494342_1537292681128270_8663445463022548193_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"fb上水人大聯盟圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/897e1ecf7533d600a4ef0b253cf5a3d2/2026-06/716776370_10242573451972832_2040445236723156341_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"fb馬路的事討論區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87e626b12f9836b8373638d9f083f457/2026-06/716250353_10174379673535507_2594517934276291868_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"fb香港交通及突發事故報料區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c71273dd009072f8b6800e64d646978/2026-06/716875521_27243494671929941_6105863569011786174_n.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-04T02:19:44.438334+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}